# Lineage — {{PROJECT_TITLE}}

The project's master index: every campaign and session, what changed, and what it found, in one place.
Append-only. Never delete a row; supersede it. Archived campaigns stay listed. A resuming agent or
colleague reads this first. Each row's `@key` links to its knowledge-base resource.

## Campaigns

`status`: active · superseded · archived(forked) · done.  `approach`: a free tag (e.g. `cnn`, `sims`, `fit`).
A fork is an invalidating update, defined in the project `CLAUDE.md`. It archives the source campaign and
starts a fresh one. Both appear here, with the fork noted.

